00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.080
But if you go to TikTok where I first started

181
00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.480
and just sort by oldest,

182
00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.840
you can see here that my content is as low effort

183
00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.080
as it can get, essentially because part of my work

184
00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.200
is dealing with AI and data was a big thing back then.

185
00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.080
I started taking a video using my phone

186
00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.920
off my screen of something that's interesting.

187
00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.800
And I was using this specific pointer

188
00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.120
