191
00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.880
But since then after posting like two to three times per day

192
00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.560
because I took so many shots on goal,

193
00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.440
I was eventually able to build a following

194
00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.640
and get videos that have millions of views in here.

195
00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.400
And on TikTok alone, I was able to build up

196
