197
00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.520
of volume and repetitions over perfection.

198
00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:46.560
And so I share this early

199
00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.400
because maybe in your very first service client

200
00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:52.280
or the very first outreach DM or email that you send,

