00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:55.000
maybe that doesn't translate to a specific outcome for you.

202
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.640
But remember that what you're building there is the muscle

203
00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:00.120
and you're slowly but surely improving your craft

204
00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.080
so that once you get to, I'd say, the 100th repetition,

205
00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.120
then you are already multitudes better

206
00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.080
than where you started, which is the key point.

207
00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.120
And then the final principle is clarity and accountability.

208
00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.440
So be clear on what you want

209
00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.160
and putting systems to be accountable to make that happen.

210
00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:14.960
And so I have a thing,

211
00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.000
what do you exactly want out of this course

212
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.640
and of this specific journey?

