00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.480
Maybe you want to build something that you own.

222
00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.160
And so my advice to you is for you to make it visible, right?

223
00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.280
It's somewhere that you'll see it.

224
00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.400
Some people put it as their phone wallpaper.

225
00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.920
Some people put it as a pinned note in their notes app,

226
00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.960
whatever works, but it's just good to be clear

227
00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:47.320
and specific and for you to see it on a daily basis if you can.

228
00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.160
And if you can,

229
00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.720
it's also good to set a target date,

230
00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.120
which would play a role later

231
00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.480
when we draft steps to reach this dream outcome of yours.

232
00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.520
And finally, this step is completely optional,

233
00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.520
but it's quite powerful.

234
00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.080
But if you share it in the community

235
00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.960
and use the template and prompt below,

236
00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.320
basically what that will give you is a goal statement

237
00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.640
that you can share in the community

238
00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.720
to get you to the stage where you are accountable

239
00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.600
for what you shared.

240
00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.360
Because it's been proven time and again

241
00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.000
that the more that you declare your goals

242
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.520
and your commitment to those goals,

243
00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:15.080
the higher the likelihood that you will achieve them.

244
00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.960
Essentially because it dramatically increases follow true.

245
00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.400
So when you tell people what you're doing,

246
00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:21.040
you're way more likely to do it

247
00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.080
because of that inherent social pressure

248
00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.480
that we have as human beings,

249
00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.080
which is good pressure in this case.

250
00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.680
And if you want to take it even further,

251
00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:28.840
what you can do in the community

252
00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.760
is to find an accountability partner.

253
00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.280
So someone at a similar stage to check in with

254
00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.400
so that you can take this course together as well.

255
00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.880
Now, just as a side note,

